{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-common-biology-19","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"biology","number":19,"points":null,"unitId":"gene","unitLabel":"분자생물학·유전자 발현","topic":"오페론·RNA·DNA","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gene","ecology","cell"],"stem":"그림은rRNA 유전자의분자생물학적분석을통해작성한생물의\n3 영역(domain) 분류체계를나타내는계통수이다.\nA, B, C 영역에속하는생물군의일반적인특성으로옳은것을\n<보기>에서모두고르면?〔단, 세포소기관은고려하지않는다.〕\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 영역A와B에속하는생물군에는오페론이있다.\nㄴ. 영역A와B에속하는생물군에는DNA와결합하는히스톤\n(histone)이있다.\nㄷ. 영역A와C에속하는생물군에는80 S 리보솜이있다.\nㄹ. 영역B와C에속하는생물군에는여러종류의RNA 중합\n효소가있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":665,"height":350,"region":0,"bbox":[35.656,52.068,266.0,140.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-common-biology-19/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":288,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,256.868,308.8,115.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-common-biology-19/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,558.569],"width":333.756,"height":405.837,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[35.656,52.068,266.0,140.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,256.868,308.8,115.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"19. 그림은rRNA 유전자의분자생물학적분석을통해작성한생물의","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.539,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"19.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.401,11